RuneLite
--------
https://github.com/runelite/runelite

The farming patch state table (src/main/resources/com/herbrunhelper/patch-states.tsv) is generated
by scripts/generate_patch_states.py from RuneLite's Time Tracking plugin (PatchImplementation.java).
The patch regions and varbit ids in FarmPatch.java match its FarmingWorld.java (checked by
scripts/verify_patches.py), and crop growth stages match its Produce.java.

