plugin (FarmingPatchLocation.java, BSD 2-Clause); spirit tree patch tiles are the patch boxes in
Shortest Path's spirit-tree-patches.tsv; calquat tiles were checked against Quest Helper's tree run.

Quest Helper
------------
https://github.com/Zoinkwiz/quest-helper

The built-in patch tiles in FarmPatch.java were checked against the patch locations in Quest
Helper's herb run and tree run helpers. Only map coordinates (facts about the game) were used; no
code was copied.
